            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "definition",
            "title": "Decision making",
            "text": "Decision making lets a program choose different actions based on conditions, much as people make decisions in real life. Python provides several conditional statements for this."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The statements are if, if-else, the short-hand if-else, if-elif-else and nested conditionals."
          }
        ]
